  subgraph Sources[Simulated source services]
    CP[customer portal] --- LG[logistics] --- WH[warehouse]
  end
  Sources -->|POST /events| GW[Event gateway - FastAPI]
  GW -->|key = return_id| K[(Kafka / Redpanda: return-events)]
