  EW -. failures after retries .-> DLQ[(return-events.dlq)]
  EW --> PG[(PostgreSQL: events, ledger, snapshots, investigations, audit)]
  API[API - FastAPI] --> PG
  API --> REC[reconciler] & ML[risk model] & VIS[vision adapter] & DEC[decision engine] & RAG[policy RAG] --> LLM[LLM provider or deterministic fallback]
  VIS -. cache .-> RD[(Redis)]
  UI[Streamlit UI] --> API
